      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 \u00b7 QUALTRICS TEST SOURCE\n**Synthetic local account + public FAKE API token. No live Qualtrics.**\nManual run or POST webhook \u2192 start export \u2192 check ready \u2192 download.\nAll three source requests send X-API-TOKEN. Local fixture is immediately ready; real adapter needs bounded polling and export parsing.\n**Closed cohort:** 20 invited; 15 raw deliveries including duplicate, revision and invalid score.",
        "width": 720,
        "height": 230,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bronze-note",
      "name": "bronze-note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -150,
        -310
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 \u00b7 BRONZE\nImmutable export + SHA-256 batch key.\n15 deliveries \u2192 **14 unique versions**.\n1 exact duplicate ignored.\nSQLite: bronze_batches + bronze_responses.\nReplay does not create new rows.",
        "width": 260,
        "height": 230,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "silver-note",
      "name": "silver-note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        -310
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 \u00b7 SILVER\nLatest version per response ID, then validate types/ranges.\n**12 accepted \u00b7 1 quarantined \u00b7 1 superseded.**\n10 completed + 2 partial.\nInvalid newest version never revives an older answer.",
        "width": 260,
        "height": 230,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gold-note",
      "name": "gold-note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        390,
        -310
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 \u00b7 GOLD\n**7 metrics** with explicit denominators:\nResponse rate \u00b7 completion rate \u00b7 engagement mean \u00b7 favorable % \u00b7 CSAT \u00b7 eNPS \u00b7 median duration.\nVersioned, atomic SQLite aggregate snapshot.\nSmall department/question groups: all department slices withheld to prevent subtraction disclosure.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 230,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "inspect-note",
      "name": "inspect-note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -150,
        340
