        "content": "## INSPECT THE DATA FLOW\nExecute workflow, then click each green HTTP node \u2192 Output \u2192 JSON.\nProduction webhook: POST http://127.0.0.1:5680/webhook/qualtrics-gold-test\nGold viewer: http://127.0.0.1:8812 \u00b7 API: /layers \u00b7 SQLite: survey_analytics/data/survey.sqlite3\nRetries: 3 attempts, 1-second wait, 10-second request timeout. Errors stop publication.\nOnly this synthetic workflow saves node outputs; HR chat execution settings are unchanged.",
        "width": 1040,
        "height": 190,
        "color": 4
